1
00:00:00,128 --> 00:00:03,465
So at this point, you learned a lot about

2
00:00:03,465 --> 00:00:06,240
the HTMX essentials and therefore

3
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:08,983
it's now time to practice what you learned.

4
00:00:09,737 --> 00:00:12,352
Now for that, I prepared a brand new

5
00:00:12,464 --> 00:00:15,560
starting project. You find it attached

6
00:00:16,138 --> 00:00:18,817
and it's again a very simple Node Express

7
00:00:18,945 --> 00:00:19,571
application

8
00:00:20,164 --> 00:00:23,100
where I essentially just return one page

9
00:00:23,292 --> 00:00:26,180
which is rendered directly in this app.js

10
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:28,326
file. All the HTML code is

11
00:00:29,021 --> 00:00:30,670
included in there as a string

12
00:00:31,268 --> 00:00:33,354
just so that we have it all in one place.

13
00:00:33,986 --> 00:00:35,078
And this one

14
00:00:35,689 --> 00:00:38,902
page in the end will show us a form

15
00:00:39,448 --> 00:00:42,726
and then a list of course goals which you

